0	section	Starting out
0	section	Talking to Lucien
1	line	Lucien	I seek a hero to go on an important mission!
1	line	Player	I am a mighty hero!
1	cond	If the player's inventory is full:
2	line	Lucien	I require the Staff of Armadyl. But if you wish to seek it for me, you must free up some inventory space so that I can give you what you need.
2	action	end
1	line	Lucien	I require the Staff of Armadyl. It is in the deserted Temple of Ikov, near Hemenster, north east of here.
1	line	Lucien	Take care hero! There is a dangerous monster somewhere in the temple!
1	option	Why can't you get it yourself?
2	line	Player	Why can't you get it yourself?
2	line	Lucien	The guardians of the Staff of Armadyl fear me!
2	line	Lucien	They have set up a magical barrier which even my power cannot overcome!
2	cond	Without the required skills or recommended combat level to complete it:
3	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that one or more of your skill levels are lower than what is required to fully complete it. Your combat level is also lower than the recommended level of 45.
2	select	Start the Temple of Ikov quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	That sounds like a laugh!
3	line	Lucien	It's not as easy as it sounds. The monster can only be killed with a weapon of ice. There are many other dangers.
3	line	Player	I'm up for it!
3	line	Lucien	I shall give you a pendant. Without it you will not be able to enter the Chamber of Fear.
3	line	Lucien	Here is my pendant. Now, I cannot stay here much longer. Meet me in my house, across the river south-east from Edgeville. It is next to the so-called Grand Exchange.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	I'll pass this time.
3	line	Lucien	Hmph.
3	action	end
1	option	Whats the reward?!
2	line	Player	What's the reward?
