3	action	above
2	option	No.
3	action	above
1	option	Oh no! Sounds far too dangerous!
2	line	Player	Oh no! Sounds far too dangerous!
2	line	Lucien	Wimp! Call yourself a hero?! My daughter is more of a hero than you!
2	action	end
