1	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Thou is a foul agent of Lucien! Such an agent must die!
0	section	Talking to a Guardian of Armadyl while not wearing the Pendant of Lucien
1	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Thou hast ventured deep into the tunnels, you have reached the temple of our master. It is many ages since a pilgrim has come here.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I seek the Staff of Armadyl.
2	line	Player	I seek the Staff of Armadyl.
2	line	Guardian of Armadyl	We are the guardians of the staff, our fathers were guardians and our fathers' fathers before that. Why dost thou seek it?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Lucien will give me a grand reward for it!
3	line	Player	Lucien will give me a grand reward for it!
3	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Thou art working for that spawn of evil?! Fool! You must be cleansed to save your soul!
3	select	Select an option
3	option	How dare you call me a fool!
4	line	Player	How dare you call me a fool! I will work for whom I want!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	We must cleanse the temple!
4	action	The guardian attacks the player.
3	option	I just thought of something I must do!
4	line	Player	I just thought of something I must do!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	An agent of evil cannot be allowed to leave!
4	action	The guardian attacks the player.
3	option	You're right, it's time for my yearly bath.
4	line	Player	You're right, it's time for my yearly bath.
4	box	The guardian splashes holy water over you.
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	You have been cleansed!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Lucien must not get hold of the staff! He would become too powerful!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Hast thou come across the undead necromancer? It was he that raised an army of the undead against Varrock a generation ago. If you know where he is you can help us defeat him.
4	select	Select an option
4	option	Ok! I'll help!
5	line	Player	Ok! I'll help!
5	line	Guardian of Armadyl	So he is close by?
5	line	Player	Yes!
5	line	Guardian of Armadyl	He must be gaining in power again. If you can defeat him he will be banished from this plane for a while. You will need this pendant to attack him.
5	box	The guardian has given you a pendant.
5	action	end
4	option	No! I shall not turn against my employer!
5	line	Player	No! I shall not turn against my employer!
5	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Fool! You will die for your sins!
5	action	The guardian attacks the player.
4	option	I need time to think.
5	line	Player	I need time to think.
5	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Linger a while and be at peace.
5	action	end
