1	option	What are your kind and what are you doing here?
2	line	Player	What are your kind and what are you doing here?
2	line	Guardian of Armadyl	We are the Guardians of Armadyl. We have kept the temple safe for many ages. The evil in the dungeons seek what lies here. The Mahjarrat are the worst.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	What is the Armadyl?
3	line	Player	What is the Armadyl?
3	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Armadyl is the god we serve. We have been charged with guarding his sacred arctifacts until he requires them.
3	select	Select an option
3	option	Ah ok, thanks.
4	line	Player	Ah ok, thanks.
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Go in peace.
4	action	end
3	option	Someone told me there were only three gods.
4	line	Player	Someone told me there were only three gods. Saradomin, Zamorak and Guthix.
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Saradominists. Bleh. They only acknowledge those three. There are at least twenty gods!
4	action	end
2	option	Who are the Mahjarrat?
3	line	Player	Who are the Mahjarrat?
3	line	Guardian of Armadyl	They are ancient and powerful beings! They are very evil! It is said that they once dominated this plane of existence, Zamorak was supposedly of their blood. They are far fewer in number now.
3	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Some still have presence in this world in their liche forms. Mahjarrat such as Lucien and Azzanadra would become very powerful if they came into possession of the Staff of Armadyl.
3	select	Select an option
3	option	Did you say Lucien?
4	line	Player	Did you say Lucien? It was Lucien that asked me to get the staff!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	You are a fool to be working for Lucien! Your soul must be cleansed to save you!
4	select	Select an option
4	option	How dare you call me a fool!
5	action	above
4	option	I just thought of something I must do!
5	action	above
4	option	You're right, it's time for my yearly bath.
5	action	above
3	option	I hope you're doing a good job then!
4	line	Player	I hope you're doing a good job then!
4	line	Guardian of Armadyl	Do not fear! We are devoted to our charge!
4	action	end
2	option	Wow! You must be really old!
3	line	Player	Wow! You must be really old!
3	line	Guardian of Armadyl	No! I am not old! My family has guarded the staff for many generations.
3	action	end
